{
  "dom_id": "step-e15094",
  "name": "Example: Identifying Boolean Functions Given Logical Operations",
  "problem": "Complete the missing values in the truth table below.\n\n| $x_1$ | $x_2$ | $x_1 \\Rightarrow x_2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $0$ | $\\bbox[3pt,border:solid 1pt]{\\phantom{\\textrm{odd}}}$ |\n| $0$ | $1$ | $\\bbox[3pt,border:solid 1pt]{\\phantom{\\textrm{odd}}}$ |\n| $1$ | $0$ | $\\bbox[3pt,border:solid 1pt]{\\phantom{\\textrm{odd}}}$ |\n| $1$ | $1$ | $\\bbox[3pt,border:solid 1pt]{\\phantom{\\textrm{odd}}}$ |",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that $\\textrm{True}=1$ and $\\textrm{False}=0.$ \n\nAlso, the implication $x_1 \\Rightarrow x_2$ is false if and only if $x_1$ is true ($1$) and $x_2$ is false ($0$).\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Boolean function is the following: \n\n| $x_1$ | $x_2$ | $x_1 \\Rightarrow x_2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $0$ | $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}1}$ |\n| $0$ | $1$ | $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}1}$ |\n| $1$ | $0$ | $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}0}$ |\n| $1$ | $1$ | $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}1}$ |",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e15094\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying Boolean Functions Given Logical Operations</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e15094\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n        